{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>APEC新聞中心今日（18日）上演武術表演，包括詠春、蔡李佛及茂名洪拳，現場傳媒記者可即場「拜師學藝」。當中廣東省級非遺傳承人、茂南洪拳師傅黃文燈帶9歲大女兒黃湘茹、7歲小女兒黃湘怡一同展示「五形拳」。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:26:03.658620+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:35:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:06:15.114850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:19:33.555808+00:00","content_hash":"cfd2635ddf1f72a729d7a0c18a4b051f368fccb98af6c5197978085cb6e40838","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}